<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 411 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 411 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board of Trade Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totalled 411 contracts compared with 598 overnight Thursday,  according to the CBOT.</p>
<p>There were 68 wheat, 116 corn, 187 soybean, 25 soymeal and 15 soyoil contracts traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was steady to one cent per bushel higher, corn was steady to 3/4 cent higher and soybeans were 3/4 to 1-3/4 cents higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
